  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The table shows the vertical component of the velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_y\"></span> of a projectile at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\\text{ s}\"></span> intervals. The projectile is launched at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 0.0\\text{ s}\"></span> and maintains a constant horizontal velocity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> / s</th><th>Vertical velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_y\"></span> / m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0.0</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>1.0</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>2.0</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>3.0</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the maximum vertical height reached by the projectile above its launch position?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">30 m</li><li data-label=\"B\">75 m</li><li data-label=\"C\">45 m</li><li data-label=\"D\">90 m</li></ol>"
